<title>USA: Bell South gets major stake in Ecuadorean co.</title>
<headline>Bell South gets major stake in Ecuadorean co.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>BellSouth Corp said Tuesday that it bought a 61 percent interest in OTECEL, one of two nationwide wireless telephone companies in Ecuador, by buying all the shares of the company's two largest stockholders, Planer Overseas Corp and Discovery Inc.</p>
</text>
